    <!-- Calm, persistent offline-reassurance banner. Replaces the old
         alarming "connection lost" pill: the durable outbox holds queued
         messages and resends them on the next connect, so the honest,
         calming truth is that nothing is lost. Strings mirror the desktop
         connectionBanner.ts verbatim so a person reads identical words
         across shells. Android has no in-pump reconnect and no separate
         daemon state (x0xd is in-process), so only the relay-down "warn"
         state is representable; the info/reconnecting state has no Android
         source and is intentionally absent. -->
    <string name="chat_offline_reassurance">No connection. Your messages are saved and will send once you\'re back online.</string>
